{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_05_001_00_5_05_001_00",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0ebca872937c21666649ac9873b059ee33faa54152af47f1b8e37b7a637b0249",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_05_001_00_5_05_001_00:5_05_001_00:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ec85bb6c9ac1e259519d281054d0f9cf4dd6c3eb09ab95db1547ccc0979a0ef",
      "text": "通往游戏世界的邀请函",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_001_00_5_05_001_00:5_05_001_00:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ba8257f99a3d7003ed35e0d660630474a82e735771863122a266c0e005c74ef",
      "text": "在大型游戏展会上，C.FIRST被选定负责演唱\n某款游戏的日版主题曲。\n听说编舞中还加入了契合游戏世界观的武戏动作，\n大家为接下来的训练提起了干劲。\n特别是秀，比平时还要更加热情高涨。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_001_00_5_05_001_00:5_05_001_00:cmd-000020:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3bd4b94ccc07076bcf1055f6b600e5c9372f0c31cff6d08c458f7cc3eed545f",
      "text": "FES",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_001_00_5_05_001_00:5_05_001_00:cmd-000020:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ec85bb6c9ac1e259519d281054d0f9cf4dd6c3eb09ab95db1547ccc0979a0ef",
      "text": "通往游戏世界的邀请函",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_001_00_5_05_001_00:5_05_001_00:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d7fc4931a6fd0332d2c4d39fd88ffad0d1f1f59d9bbb98ae8c9483f94977e7f",
      "text": "这款游戏的日文版主题曲，由我们来唱？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_001_00_5_05_001_00:5_05_001_00:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:382ee877211a0299b7bc871a5d66620580c1412dc2d8d1b43e287141bb16b673",
      "text": "是的。要请各位在大型游戏展会上演唱！\n顺带一提，主题曲的编舞中，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_001_00_5_05_001_00:5_05_001_00:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc26b7324e4f475da094c88c4bb86e2c178b47d3f72857db4f4f311970dcae63",
      "text": "似乎加入了体现游戏世界观的\n武戏动作呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_001_00_5_05_001_00:5_05_001_00:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95ae94509fdb2f5733aebfbef8196b5b029a3fd1fcff6e7f0667bf56b6766233",
      "text": "嘿，听起来挺有意思的嘛。能给我看看资料吗？\n诶……服装上，还配有武器吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_001_00_5_05_001_00:5_05_001_00:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2a8948a57f89f6fe43b0710c3c3f90157deae6e16422f384bb4d109f2fe1eea",
      "text": "我是枪，百百人前辈是飞轮……\n锐心前辈是剑啊。哇，总觉得挺符合印象的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_001_00_5_05_001_00:5_05_001_00:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44ef907fbf5b545f563223a22a55960b73edd4191481284cfde15c81b0f0f5cc",
      "text": "“飞轮”这个名字本身我是听说过啦，\n不过到底是什么样的武器呢……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_001_00_5_05_001_00:5_05_001_00:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c38a835cc5daef5ba996cfeee249d71181dd9543bb8e67d129dd04237323f536",
      "text": "飞轮是一种既能投掷也能近身斩击的武器。\n在日本被称为战轮，据说曾由忍者使用。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_001_00_5_05_001_00:5_05_001_00:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e73c65808b9fe52d2febeb1cd18650141246d08e64dd92e06c57df554be1a52",
      "text": "眉见君，你对武器很了解嘛？\n还是说，你玩过这款游戏？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_001_00_5_05_001_00:5_05_001_00:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3167023bb242a9e0f2be6c6f617b41601a2c4a13b7435c2795168274d5b22d0",
      "text": "不，是看电影得来的知识。\n这种领域的话，秀应该更熟悉吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_001_00_5_05_001_00:5_05_001_00:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1773739814093acc447023e160d64dfded74871300530df1f37b1624cef5a980",
      "text": "这家公司出的游戏我玩过好几款，\n所以连系统特性我都一清二楚哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_001_00_5_05_001_00:5_05_001_00:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e04934757bea25bae8eb54e9e95ff2d3bcdf1a096d98a42bc079fd2ac335a678",
      "text": "总之先亲自玩一玩，体会一下世界观吧。\n由我来给你们做特训，交给我吧。前辈们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_001_00_5_05_001_00:5_05_001_00:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23fdaf9d58336601dfc34d0284283a8fd52626f380ca3580f2c66f6438294da7",
      "text": "嗯。指导就拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_001_00_5_05_001_00:5_05_001_00:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:747f44965b1a64ea3eb2b84ff2c892b3f2f9c43134b4e1491cde5b24804530cd",
      "text": "请多指教啦，天峰君。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
